today's one minute monday is  connect with people you cannot do  this business on your own okay to build  something great  you need to connect with people and get  people to help you grow  every time i go away to another city i  try to connect with the people on my  newsletter people who  are fans see if i can help them out in  any way i just got back from orlando  speaking at a conference and i had a  crazy packed schedule i had a morning  two hour session i was leading  then a lunch that was a networking lunch  i was hosting  did an afternoon two-hour session i was  leading then  a dinner and an events award where i had  to  present the award for best social media  and  and then i wanted to go salsa dancing of  course after right so it was a crazy  late night  and i thought wow i have no time how am  i going to connect with people on my  newsletter list like i always like to do  i don't think i'm going to be able to do  it because i had to leave the next day  and i thought you know what  i got to find a way i gotta find a way  to do it because i love connecting with  people  and the only time i had was the morning  the day of my flight it was sunday  morning  nine a.m i said you know what if people  want to come meet me for sunday 9 a.m  coffee  i'll meet with them and i put out a  notice to my newsletter list and i met  mike and dave two amazing entrepreneurs  from orlando we had a great conversation  i was able to connect with them help  them grow their business they both  left super happy and overwhelmed and  mike even gave me a ride to the airport  after  thank you mike so connect with people  even if you have a crazy schedule like  we all have you need to find  time in your week every single week to  connect with people reach out to them  try to make their lives better see how  they can help you with your business  because you cannot  do this all on your own you need the  support of the people in your network  believe for those who watching like the  video thumbs up below  support me by the link below leave a  comment subscribe to the channel i'll  see you soon
 

